msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1A2ABFC_9FF9_4BC4_A64A_1C3ED1056E83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This would have been a very different story...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫had you not discovered the truth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sarebbe stata tutt’altra storia...⟪k:1⟫ se lei, Padrone, non avesse scoperto⟪k:2⟫la verità."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FB527226_CAA5_4839_90B7_7F04A2DE290B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e8112a5aee988d740fd39edb7ab54be1b53b8314049cdb5495bc05d4bd99cc9
#. default-sha256: 30faaa1327810063167a1d2de053b76e01c37a6a088b6fcf89f73334e3a82249
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FB527226_CAA5_4839_90B7_7F04A2DE290B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A beast meets a white-haired girl and learns humanity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Una bestia conosce una ragazza dai capelli bianchi e apprende l’umanità."

#: scenario2:scenario2_62228A2A_0C5A_41F9_A8AC_B3ABE806B459
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cd6a9abe78a0a671f862cdc7d247c2f40d09db35649a7d6ada6442b774a2c62
#. default-sha256: 31ceb5df9faa4119c51086231fc22ac6426acc6f55d03c47d2c0858aa93b2807
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_62228A2A_0C5A_41F9_A8AC_B3ABE806B459"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That tale would have been far easier on you, I’m sure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sono certa che quel racconto sarebbe stato molto più comodo per lei."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E7DB052E_DAD7_459E_BC56_0801A835C943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaa87b697626e6114271f9b4dc1d43e51f6d7ef0a19dd1e9acc156875f4d02f7
#. default-sha256: 48d9bd7c32f17c9ae6f67a25a7bd5af8ad0d69d7b9ed1cb65d67b5507ca7b896
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E7DB052E_DAD7_459E_BC56_0801A835C943"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By remaining in the dark...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and seeing the story through his eyes alone...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"you would not have had to witness that poor girl’s miserable death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rimanendo all’oscuro di tutto...⟪k:1⟫ e vedendo la storia solo attraverso⟪k:2⟫gli occhi "
"della bestia...⟪k:3⟫ non avrebbe assistito alla miserabile morte⟪k:4⟫di quella povera ragazza."

#: scenario2:scenario2_77A688CC_59DB_4A8A_80D6_2805FD5F2A7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70cff079b4fc1a7dc47cdea9452678d43a8ac5ffb0b34c9193d0a5c180ec8a18
#. default-sha256: 8558e5d0b495fe1007fb457bca2bdd763cf2ad4c4c58ad35423e0b5526b6fb65
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_77A688CC_59DB_4A8A_80D6_2805FD5F2A7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that, perhaps, would have been better for you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E probabilmente sarebbe stato meglio per lei, Padrone..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_73EE22AD_3CAF_4942_824E_45B6B1CDBEE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96782e2553632d71b56e869edc01fd5ebf4cbdfb7f4079bc76fc9b7be22ce6cf
#. default-sha256: 4650ddc5a10ca243985bd10a111a6b40cbf3a431e3c68603d56af9214ffeaef2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_73EE22AD_3CAF_4942_824E_45B6B1CDBEE0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the reality you observed through her eyes changes the “truth” of his tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma la realtà che ha osservato attraverso gli occhi della donna⟪k:1⟫ha cambiato “la verità” "
"di questo racconto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F06712C1_33E1_46A7_A834_ABA7C4446DD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8b5eadb66c54d049ca2908348e4bd88a2619188faec7607fdbcc0f49367ee22
#. default-sha256: f01856129ff15335ee25bcae626a9d98468c0653d30a700e3f5b3cc60c3ef38d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F06712C1_33E1_46A7_A834_ABA7C4446DD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it sounds like the visions you had did not run in parallel to the events I described for "
"you, but took place slightly earlier in time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E pare che gli eventi delle visioni che ha avuto non siano accadute in contemporanea con "
"quelli che io le ho narrato, ma che abbiano avuto luogo leggermente prima nel tempo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BAD9CECE_2467_4392_A237_3083253B13FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69cdf80a405ef5fab3adf0310696261b22d0c174aeeb7abbc94353d1a0a4f00a
#. default-sha256: 1ec737b12999f70d7c07370aba6969c59a9e8b89a7c5a10c311b21f4f1e09026
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BAD9CECE_2467_4392_A237_3083253B13FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Which means that, yes..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ciò significa che, sì..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_106E860A_A5CC_4547_82EE_632DB286BF3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0dcb1ff1a06991be238322611c5013342969aa8b311bcfcdd383fb586296288d
#. default-sha256: 12b3f5b1df2ea1f9567f6bbca508620ec69afe8724dd344504ea6e4cdb778841
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_106E860A_A5CC_4547_82EE_632DB286BF3C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her fate was set in stone well before you ever saw it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫il destino della ragazza era già inciso sulla pietra ancor prima che lei potesse vederlo, "
"Padrone."

#: scenario2:scenario2_874CF45D_CA2E_46BD_A676_AFE0AB026104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 501c0de57337494f65fd0cd7f72af9dfdb22b91ac8d9d6f3408f8eaf87db8644
#. default-sha256: 9bd3b7740b932dec75079dfea1830a86fbe59c4f07212be9947e7df170203cb6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_874CF45D_CA2E_46BD_A676_AFE0AB026104"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I do have to wonder, though—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫why did Bestia believe the woman to be a beast "
"like him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi chiedo, tuttavia—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫perché Bestia ha creduto che la donna fosse una bestia come "
"lui?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_33BC129B_C537_4C10_ABB6_F03ABFCA7ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41c0eecdffe21fe5356ffc5e64994e1b0a5bbd2894190252880cde3b7e4ae422
#. default-sha256: 3977d4747bc46e0ebb1dd75b9ca18be5895d7e07da8395472f2b6d7d2a8f7b4b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33BC129B_C537_4C10_ABB6_F03ABFCA7ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Perhaps it was because her hair, eye, and skin color were similar to his own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Forse perché il colore dei loro capelli, degli occhi, e della pelle erano simili...?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_89DD8F69_6BF8_4447_95E2_60A204FA750B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 689c98b267e2cbe7b19c3da083dc1ef2eea32c94268aa38803f7fba619eea914
#. default-sha256: d45da58a0c5db0a24abe9a7ddf48e72fb20b9a106b1ee2b3345b3b6c1b0823ab
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_89DD8F69_6BF8_4447_95E2_60A204FA750B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The poor young woman who called upon the mansion did, indeed, resemble Bestia."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La povera, giovane donna che aveva raggiunto la villa, infatti, richiamava l’aspetto di "
"Bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_13DF9A7B_EC52_4D1F_8FD2_14F26ED935D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4c5e3ec42e5b602aa31b9a82f8b28a922367073e30bd245f1d19b00188004ae
#. default-sha256: 7699374657d6abedc347b80b89c690fba747c742df64ea070de6a66f7b844a9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_13DF9A7B_EC52_4D1F_8FD2_14F26ED935D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were of a similar race."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Facevano parte di una razza simile."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3DEB76D0_C400_41A6_86CB_AADC4D54BC79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e36c4e7037ba23bca8257c150322bc7113b5518652baa2b0064dfe1a2d19b332
#. default-sha256: 161817a48629ee968c4108dc328c741bf583b9e344a852b81d5de5f0d90181cd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3DEB76D0_C400_41A6_86CB_AADC4D54BC79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Half of her blood was of the same race as his."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Metà del sangue della ragazza apparteneva alla sua stessa etnia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B269F7E_7BD0_4536_B157_071365C1498D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58eaf46260cf1c1ae8fa67cf745c956ad184076359ef51df60c4c805cb2eaa6b
#. default-sha256: ede36a26b4948bf6b5f234e80b3776de2273b448f36c02e7062e9e1c16ae7a11
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B269F7E_7BD0_4536_B157_071365C1498D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But was that the only reason?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Would that be enough for him to mistake her for a "
"beast?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma quella era l’unica ragione?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era sufficiente perché lui la scambiasse per una "
"bestia?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9C5A2C33_8B58_4458_8D69_BF0232B854AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e1bde738fb301fb59eb94904adace5a5b19dc035998ac349a081c17584511cb
#. default-sha256: e282dd5564c404063678a188a3fefb21820b9a9191bbce4fed2449af40479019
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9C5A2C33_8B58_4458_8D69_BF0232B854AE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have my own theory—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his memories may have played a role."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho una mia teoria—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫le sue memorie potrebbero aver giocato un ruolo importante."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2946D2EC_E581_45DF_9D8B_B7A09205D04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20899760e6b454665569293347d3ba57791d0e2860bf01a0fc764f9ac13c33d2
#. default-sha256: 466017a939e00125e475555a5a6f6a5b20eafd87504b56c6d081caa0af17addb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2946D2EC_E581_45DF_9D8B_B7A09205D04B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suspect Bestia was afraid the memories from when he was “human” would cause him to waver."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sospetto che Bestia abbia avuto paura che i propri ricordi di quando era “umano” lo "
"avrebbero fatto vacillare."

#: scenario2:scenario2_98F60F19_0750_4D1D_92B7_3425D74D193D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4075a8a890c46e7c4405974abd7295499788c2ef644c7063afbe78166b4711a
#. default-sha256: 61f3387fb7353fead56fd318412bcea93230170a16c221dd1bc833e2713696aa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_98F60F19_0750_4D1D_92B7_3425D74D193D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that is simply my own speculation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps he had merely lost his grip on "
"reality."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma è solo una mia ipotesi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Può darsi che avesse semplicemente perso di vista la "
"realtà."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B5A92AD_EA04_4094_81EE_93FFE9E10F0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed1b75f8bddd8ca611bf983848995720b70f42fd8d2f9672ade9f202b66dac6d
#. default-sha256: 35e02e97f735649ee05f092e9bb2680db4d8dda839eae9b84de8cbdf1bfe198c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B5A92AD_EA04_4094_81EE_93FFE9E10F0A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How well have you come to understand Bestia, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi dica, Padrone, quanto ha compreso di Bestia?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B679438_AE79_44E5_BE4C_4CB4E204C918
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4378a1eb0c575b097c22ee8db46d4dd85b2405868d7ccb2c3a62207c8ed37a12
#. default-sha256: 0f2d24fffd152a7a3d6f7b409585e9357b91365fc2c3bbf886b9ab35b17f92ee
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B679438_AE79_44E5_BE4C_4CB4E204C918"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You ⟪k:1⟫do⟪k:2⟫ appear to think he was an ordinary human who believed himself to be a beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lei sembra pensare che fosse un uomo normale che credeva di essere una bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF588D14_E9C6_434D_A3A6_CCAD57B87EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55de3827b75d8e36a441defc5015c5e0d76c306398ddfc25b244e45aee420b56
#. default-sha256: 493c7a0b4f4c568675d79985b456fbd76d70088bd1fae4ed6a8a77f74a2f3d8d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF588D14_E9C6_434D_A3A6_CCAD57B87EFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But where... ⟪k:1⟫does the line between man and beast truly lie?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma la linea che separa le due cose... ⟪k:1⟫fin dove arriva realmente?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3FD44329_FA98_4D23_9759_54C51EFC9104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f32ec7bf6a756aa75c6f907bbb7b8a71c988f723af11a5bc0447ac547d30ad11
#. default-sha256: d6683f3e36f50d52aada00df8e85423e13c900f9417bd28d83af95ff68097930
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3FD44329_FA98_4D23_9759_54C51EFC9104"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That I do not know."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Questo non saprei dirlo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DA791398_946B_4073_A5E2_43A80A4225D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0043529ef1f54da45bbf7294c7619558a5035ff2ac9bc12b7518ccfa845447cf
#. default-sha256: 06fde584d00db27a238879207d07331ca80cad9e9c67a51cdfc998c45250cd1b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DA791398_946B_4073_A5E2_43A80A4225D3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Master, if—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like Bestia—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫you were to lose your memories and endure "
"persecution and degradation until you broke..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Padrone, se lei dovesse perdere la memoria come Bestia, finendo per patire la stessa "
"oppressione e umiliazione fino a crollare..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2455FA0D_CF54_4510_864E_951197A99F35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2644945a3bf9cfd769ac0ec5b1998635787139430adf61ee27ad7575fd31e7f5
#. default-sha256: 32e26629aae197e25b259d7b338f88e533b012e78ccc09cd337f8848f38be57a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2455FA0D_CF54_4510_864E_951197A99F35"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫would you still remember those you care for?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫si ricorderebbe ancora dei suoi cari?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BA8FEFFF_B069_4A73_8260_AC368B269E5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d20d8d2c5db19703a4a602536d6a71b0ed9828690864c1183dbdc383f915bbc7
#. default-sha256: 033233a2e2da6ce0f9d31151dfff489832bdc5181ee198c5b596a1148ece7c52
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BA8FEFFF_B069_4A73_8260_AC368B269E5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Now, our tale is not yet over.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The web of misfortune was tightly, oh so tightly "
"entangled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Dunque, la nostra storia non si è ancora conclusa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I fili della disgrazia erano "
"così... ⟪k:3⟫strettamente aggrovigliati."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DB158C2D_F0EB_422E_947E_27340295256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edfa0993ba0ed5a5bb297e4dce1895413a4d3ecda88584c504b5656670a4ac01
#. default-sha256: 23d78e191a2f35aaa41db1edfefd763ba94a3736e3f8c4839a966f02f5f1867d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DB158C2D_F0EB_422E_947E_27340295256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It could not be unraveled."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E non potevano essere districati."

#: scenario2:scenario2_AFFE18EE_446C_4D74_A03A_DE5918DD6093
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2dc026f802b010aa410eaa2aac6e8b659536b1d8186280cd32ad0cf95e9a0a5
#. default-sha256: 18d2eeb0bfcc59f9bbc2bf2091367ea6d63815863f3c2c7f4f14fa4097937cd6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_AFFE18EE_446C_4D74_A03A_DE5918DD6093"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let us return now from her memories to the point we left off in our story."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ritorniamo al nostro racconto, laddove l’abbiamo interrotto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6DF558A9_07FA_4263_8278_50C319BB4406
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff9dd68e6a4f6303a93fc727521dfff2666398791934aa865caa6be87178d0bc
#. default-sha256: 2ea34dd09b649677ad1b2c1a2a13179562259dec4f8f650bc2b5ab23f281c9b2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6DF558A9_07FA_4263_8278_50C319BB4406"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just after the White-Haired Girl had disrobed, showing Bestia the difference between her and "
"him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Poco dopo che la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi si era svestita,⟪k:1⟫mostrando a Bestia la "
"differenza tra loro due."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2567FF9A_5979_4306_94FE_B40470F900B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16f0eb791e3b0aa98da2b7f5a0276a49b3c0059cc68a9283dd955a3b25864070
#. default-sha256: e3edafa8958b721651fa6364c575138d9930ed922beb75c8f437e3dfdecf882e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2567FF9A_5979_4306_94FE_B40470F900B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was, yes, several days following the young woman’s death.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The blood in the "
"hall had been cleaned up,⟪k:3⟫and there was no trace of it any longer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sì, questo accadde diversi giorni dopo la morte della giovane donna.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il corridoio "
"era stato pulito dal sangue, e non ve ne era più alcuna traccia."

